 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 519143,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Recall Heather’s budget from Example 6.49. She decides she wants to buy her own home, which would increase her expenses. Instead of $1,050.00 in rent, she would pay $1,240.00 for her mortgage. Her utilities costs would increase to $295.00 per month. Add these to Heather’s budget to determine if the changes are affordable.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Her new budget:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Income</td>\n<td>Amount</td>\n<td>Expense</td>\n<td>Amount</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nursing</td>\n<td>$3,765.40</td>\n<td>Mortgage</td>\n<td>$1,240.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Part-time</td>\n<td>$672.00</td>\n<td>Car payment</td>\n<td>$489.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Student loan</td>\n<td>$728.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Car insurance</td>\n<td>$139.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Utilities</td>\n<td>$295.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Clothing</td>\n<td>$150.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Entertainment</td>\n<td>$300.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Credit card</td>\n<td>$200.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Food</td>\n<td>$400.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Gasoline</td>\n<td>$250.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total</td>\n<td>$4,437.40</td>\n<td>Total</td>\n<td>$4,191.00</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>New income – expenses = $246.40 with the mortgage and increase in utilities.</p>\n<p>She still has an excess in her budget.</p>\n<p>She would change from a rent of $1,050 to a mortgage of $1,240.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1,240-1,050 = \\$ 190\"></span> This is an increase of $190.</p>\n<p>Her utilities would also change from $130 to $295.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"295-130 = 165\"></span> This is an increase of $165.</p>\n<p>This is an overall increase of <span data-math=\"190 + 165 = \\$ 355.\"></span></p>\n<p>Her budget in the example had an excess of $601.40 as a cushion. Her cushion can cover this $355 increase in expenses.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Heather’s budget is now<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Income Source</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n<th>Expense</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Nursing</td>\n<td>$3,765.40</td>\n<td>Mortgage</td>\n<td>$1,240</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Part-time</td>\n<td>$672.00</td>\n<td>Car Payment</td>\n<td>$489</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Student Loan</td>\n<td>$728</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Car Insurance</td>\n<td>$139</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Utilities</td>\n<td>$295</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Clothing</td>\n<td>$150</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Entertainment</td>\n<td>$300</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Credit Card</td>\n<td>$200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Food</td>\n<td>$400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Gasoline</td>\n<td>$250</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\nThe changes have added $355.00 to her budget. As her extra income is $601.40, she can afford the changes."
    }
   ],
